    "Factory and Matcher retain closed typed causes; facade policy errors keep their existing diagnostic conversion boundaries.",
    "No generic recovery of raw poisoned Parser APIs or native completion authority is introduced.",
    "Finite managed grammar byte admission remains Unknown and the full family/path goal is incomplete.",
